# size-ratchet exclusion list — pattern<TAB>reason, glob against the full
# repo-relative path, `*` crosses `/`. See third_party/size-ratchet/README.md.
#
# Divergence from the fleet's 400/800 split, stated per the 2026-08-10 audit:
# the engine exposes ONE threshold, so the fleet's 800-line test allowance
# cannot be expressed here. Oversized Go `_test.go` files and the
# `scripts/test-*.js` harnesses simply enter the baseline instead — acceptable,
# since a baselined test still cannot grow, and it needs no second gate.
backend/vendor/*	vendored Go modules (go mod vendor for offline Nix builds), upstream-owned
config/vshell/nvim/colorschemes/*	vendored upstream colorscheme plugins, upstream-owned
third_party/*	byte-pinned vendored trees (review-gate, size-ratchet, coderabbit-schema, asdcontrol)
quickshell/*/assets/*	shipped binary/data assets, not source
themes/*	shipped theme packages (palettes, backgrounds, generated app targets), not source
